{"unit_id":"WintryGrass__dsh-multi-candidate#card-zh","repo":"WintryGrass/dsh-multi-candidate","commit":"4bdf1107089d226264922ffe7fdec3e0155b295f","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-multi-candidate（DSH 插件，Web 客户端）：为 DSH 提供多候选生成与验证选优工作流。插件在 Web 界面注入可拖动的悬浮面板，通过设置和 system prompt 把启用状态及候选参数传入当前会话，并注册 multi_candidate_run 工具输出 workflow 参数。主要能力包括配置 2 至 5 个候选、填写验证标准、要求第二意见复核，以及将任务与当前会话模式组合。适合希望比较多个方案并让验证者评选的 DSH 用户；最终编排依赖宿主的 workflow 工具，不需要插件自带的 API Key。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-48","lib/index.js:84-101","lib/client.js:178-247","examples/multi-candidate-workflow.js:22-59"]}
{"unit_id":"WintryGrass__dsh-multi-candidate#card-en","repo":"WintryGrass/dsh-multi-candidate","commit":"4bdf1107089d226264922ffe7fdec3e0155b295f","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-multi-candidate adds a floating Web panel to configure parallel answer generation. Its tool passes candidate count and review settings to a host workflow, which generates candidates and selects one. Prompt settings are scoped to a session; workflow execution depends on the host.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:22-48","lib/index.js:84-101","lib/client.js:178-247","examples/multi-candidate-workflow.js:22-59"]}
